<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>POP GIRL</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lexie Liu</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">POP GIRL</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1diiLBOnInnwZjMnRyKWQT</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.670" end="00:02.730">Skin clear, hair shiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.730" end="00:04.270">Girls and gays like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.270" end="00:06.260">Tap, I'm on your screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.260" end="00:07.760">I serve my Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.710" end="00:09.900">Skin clear, hair shiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.900" end="00:11.440">Girls and gays like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.440" end="00:13.230">Tap, I'm on your screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.230" end="00:15.180">I serve my Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.180" end="00:16.830">Skin clear, hair shiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.830" end="00:18.740">Girls and gays like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.740" end="00:20.750">Tap, I'm on your screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.750" end="00:22.440">I serve my Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.440" end="00:24.400">Skin clear, hair shiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.400" end="00:26.200">Girls and gays like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.200" end="00:28.200">Tap, I'm on your screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.200" end="00:29.870">I serve my Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.870" end="00:33.670">Walk!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.670" end="00:37.240">Spin!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.240" end="00:40.750">Smile!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.750" end="00:44.450">Now post it!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.450" end="00:45.950">P.G.C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.920" end="00:47.970">I serve Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.970" end="00:52.090">I cover magazines after 9 hours of sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.090" end="00:54.100">P.G.C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.100" end="00:55.600">My skirt matching my tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.340" end="00:59.310">See the way that I'm walking, it's my accessory</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.310" end="01:00.810">P.G.C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.770" end="01:02.960">I serve Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.960" end="01:06.570">I cover magazines after 9 hours of sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.570" end="01:08.370">P.G.C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.370" end="01:10.430">My skirt matching my tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.430" end="01:14.100">See the way that I'm walking, it's my accessory</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.100" end="01:17.730">Walk!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.730" end="01:21.300">Spin!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.300" end="01:24.930">Smile!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.930" end="01:28.930">They like it!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.930" end="01:32.540">I photoshop my pictures till I look good for IG</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.540" end="01:36.240">Doomscroll, I wish I could kiss anxiety bye bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.240" end="01:39.920">All night, I just swipe away my little self esteem</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.920" end="01:41.770">Insecurity</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.770" end="01:43.690">There's no cure for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.690" end="01:47.470">I need a beauty filter when I'm making TikTok</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.470" end="01:50.990">Doomscroll, I wish I could kiss anxiety bye bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.990" end="01:54.780">All night, should've put my phone away in Ziploc</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.780" end="01:56.560">I hate jealousy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.560" end="02:00.290">Now I gotta affirm myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.290" end="02:02.340">Skin clear, hair shiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.340" end="02:04.030">Girls and gays like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.030" end="02:05.920">Tap, I'm on your screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.920" end="02:07.780">I serve my Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.780" end="02:09.880">Skin clear, hair shiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.880" end="02:11.450">Girls and gays like me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.450" end="02:13.470">Tap, I'm on your screen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.470" end="02:15.160">I serve my Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.160" end="02:16.660">P.G.C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.450" end="02:18.400">I serve Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.400" end="02:22.470">I cover magazines after 9 hours of sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.470" end="02:24.120">P.G.C</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.120" end="02:26.170">My skirt matching my tee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.170" end="02:29.840">See the way that I'm walking, it's my accessory</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.840" end="02:33.080">P.G.C I serve Pop Girl Chic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.080" end="02:37.080" /></div></body></tt>